--- !u!114 &2923593988989576047
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6840640017911917145}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The final stage of our game isn''t entirely clear at first glance, so
    here''s a brief explanation.


    To defeat the boss, you must destroy four
    generators (smaller cubes on the sides), and then kill the fleeing enemy that
    appears. You need to click on the cube, which then results in falling rocks onto
    the boss (core).


    To make things more difficult, the core in the center
    of the map will attack us with three attack patterns that INSTANTLY KILL us!
    Here they are:

    - Laser base - Lasers rotate in a triangle shape, firing
    after a short delay when the markers stop.

    - Laser rain - Lasers are thrown
    from the sky at random points. Every laser in the series will ALWAYS target one
    of our companions.

    - Laser spin - The laser is activated and makes one full
    rotation. Between partners, he gives us a moment to react without danger, but
    in the moment of respite, X robots appear in one of the passages (depending on
    the boss''s damage level) to engage both miners and defenders in battle.


    While
    we destroy all the cores (cubes), the antagonist will flee from us, occasionally
    stopping to fire a laser at one of our robots. If we get too close to him and
    he''s near one of the four doors, he''ll jump from one of them to another, leaving
    enemies behind.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4987f747a1d16d94ab01c614fe81fdd5, type: 2}
